	<true/>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM uses your camera to capture a photo for attendance verification during punch-in and punch-out.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM requires microphone access to support camera functionality.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM tracks your location during an active Punch session to build your work timeline. Location is collected from Punch In to Punch Out and is never collected outside a session.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM tracks your location during an active Punch session to build your work timeline. Location is collected from Punch In to Punch Out and is never collected outside a session.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM uses your location while the app is open to record your attendance Punch In and Punch Out location accurately.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM needs access to your photo library to upload documents and profile images.</string>
	<key>NSUserNotificationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>TAX HRM uses notifications to send Punch In, Punch Out, attendance reminders, and important work updates.</string>
